From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fluorite Integration Role
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 19:35:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] filament-view: place render surface above Flutter parent

The Flutter parent surface is full-screen and opaque in the QEMU runtime.
Placing the Filament subsurface below it hides every native pixel. Keep the
native view above the parent so translucent Filament content can be composed
with the Flutter UI.

---
 .../filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc                  | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc
--- a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc
+++ b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc
@@ -139,1 +139,1 @@ void ViewTarget::setupWaylandSubsurface() {
-  wl_subsurface_place_below(subsurface_, parent_surface_);
+  wl_subsurface_place_above(subsurface_, parent_surface_);
-- 
2.34.1
